  "design": {
    "idea": "Contraband alley ambush separated by a sealed bulkhead: power the Waterway Portal, Harpoon-tow or detonate a live Buoy Mine, warp behind the Crab Warden and Pistol Shrimps to claim Key #2, Ship Log 3, and the Cycle 3 drain chute to r4.",
